  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The surface temperature of star P is twice the surface temperature of star Q and its luminosity is four times the luminosity of star Q.</p>\n<p>What is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textup{radius of star Q}}{\\textup{radius of star P}}\\,?\"></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
